    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1070">

                <pb facs="1429" n="1419" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg1419"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.115/12–1445: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Tientsin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Myers</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tientsin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-14T17:00:00+08:00">December 14,
                            1945—5 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 15—5:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>29. [To Embassy:] Settlement WPO [<hi rendition="#italic">WTB</hi>]<anchor n="61"
                        xml:id="d1070-f1"/> booty cases evident[ly stopped?] our [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">and</hi>] delay in releasing Karagheusian <pb
                        facs="1430" n="1420" xml:id="pg1420"/> property may be partly due to delay
                    in turning over to Chinese of Jap military supplies held by Marines.</p>
                <p>The end [<hi rendition="#italic">trend</hi>] toward preferred treatment of
                    Americans shown in Executive Yuan orders to [Mayor,] Mytel 26, December 7,
                    undesirable unless they accord most-favored-nation treatment to other Allies,
                    essential to equitable solution entire problem.</p>
                <p>Sent to Embassy, repeated to Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Myers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1070-f1" n="61" xml:id="d1070-f1-content">
                <p>War Transportation Board.</p>
            </note>
